{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0011-container-with-most-water","title":"LeetCode 11 盛最多水的容器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0011-container-with-most-water","wordCount":867,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-11-盛最多水的容器\">LeetCode 11 盛最多水的容器</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个长度为 <code>n</code> 的整数数组 <code>height</code>。有 <code>n</code> 条垂线，第 <code>i</code> 条线的两个端点是 <code>(i, 0)</code> 和 <code>(i, height[i])</code>。</p>\n<p>找出其中的两条线，使得它们与 x 轴共同构成的容器可以容纳最多的水。返回容器可以储存的最大水量。</p>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong> 你不能倾斜容器。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>n == height.length</code></li>\n<li><code>2 &lt;= n &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= height[i] &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：height = [1, 8, 6, 2, 5, 4, 8, 3, 7]&#10;输出：49&#10;解释：图中垂直线代表输入数组 [1,8,6,2,5,4,8,3,7]。&#10;     容器能容纳水的最大值为 49（底边长 8-1=7，高 min(8,7)=7）。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：height = [1, 8, 6, 2, 5, 4, 8, 3, 7]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：49</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：图中垂直线代表输入数组 [1,8,6,2,5,4,8,3,7]。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     容器能容纳水的最大值为 49（底边长 8-1=7，高 min(8,7)=7）。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：height = [1, 1]&#10;输出：1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：height = [1, 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题是双指针技巧在数组问题中最经典的应用之一。关键在于理解为什么双指针方法不会遗漏最优解——这需要严密的数学证明支撑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"暴力解法\">暴力解法</h3><p>枚举所有可能的左右边界对 <code>(i, j)</code>，计算面积 <code>min(height[i], height[j]) × (j - i)</code>，取最大值。时间复杂度 O(n²)，在 <code>n = 10^5</code> 时会超时。</p>\n<h3 id=\"双指针法\">双指针法</h3><p>使用左右两个指针 <code>left</code> 和 <code>right</code>，分别从数组两端出发向中间移动。每一步移动较短的那一边。</p>\n<p><strong>核心直觉：</strong> 面积 = min(左高, 右高) × 宽度。当宽度缩小时，面积要变大只能让高度变大。而高度取决于较短的一边，所以移动较短的一边才有机会找到更高的线，从而可能获得更大的面积。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么移动较短边是安全的？</strong></p>\n<p>假设 <code>height[left] &lt; height[right]</code>。此时如果移动 <code>right</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>宽度减小了</li>\n<li>新的高度 = min(height[left], height[new_right]) ≤ height[left]（因为 min 不会超过 left 的高度）</li>\n<li>所以面积一定不会增大</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此，所有以 <code>left</code> 为左边界且 <code>right</code> 在当前 <code>right</code> 左边的组合，面积都不会超过当前面积。可以安全跳过。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>正确性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力枚举</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>一定正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双指针（移动较短边）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>可以证明正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双指针（移动较长边）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>不正确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxArea(height: number[]): number {&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = height.length - 1;&#10;  let maxWater = 0;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt; right) {&#10;    const width = right - left;&#10;    const h = Math.min(height[left], height[right]);&#10;    maxWater = Math.max(maxWater, width * h);&#10;&#10;    if (height[left] &lt; height[right]) {&#10;      left++;&#10;    } else {&#10;      right--;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxWater;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxArea</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxWater </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(height[left], height[right]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxWater </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxWater, width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (height[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[right]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxWater;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>执行过程示例：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>height = [1, 8, 6, 2, 5, 4, 8, 3, 7]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>left</th>\n<th>right</th>\n<th>h[left]</th>\n<th>h[right]</th>\n<th>面积</th>\n<th>maxWater</th>\n<th>移动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>1×8=8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>left++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>7×7=49</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>right--</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3×6=18</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>right--</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8×5=40</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>right--</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4×4=16</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>right--</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>5×3=15</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>right--</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2×2=4</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>right--</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6×1=6</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>right--</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最终返回 49。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进一步优化-跳过不可能更优的高度\">进一步优化：跳过不可能更优的高度</h3><p>在移动指针时，可以跳过所有不高于当前高度的线段，因为它们不可能产生更大的面积：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxArea(height: number[]): number {&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = height.length - 1;&#10;  let maxWater = 0;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt; right) {&#10;    const h = Math.min(height[left], height[right]);&#10;    maxWater = Math.max(maxWater, h * (right - left));&#10;&#10;    if (height[left] &lt; height[right]) {&#10;      while (left &lt; right &amp;&amp; height[left] &lt;= h) {&#10;        left++;&#10;      }&#10;    } else {&#10;      while (left &lt; right &amp;&amp; height[right] &lt;= h) {&#10;        right--;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxWater;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxArea</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxWater </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(height[left], height[right]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxWater </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxWater, h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (height[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[right]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[right] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxWater;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>双指针最多各移动 n 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>只使用常数个变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> 左指针只向右移动，右指针只向左移动，两者移动次数之和最多为 n-1。因此总时间为 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> 只使用了 <code>left</code>、<code>right</code>、<code>maxWater</code> 等常数个变量，空间为 O(1)。</p>\n<p><strong>双指针方法的适用模式：</strong> 本题的双指针属于「对撞指针」模式——两个指针从两端向中间移动。这种模式通常用于排序数组上的搜索问题（如两数之和的排序版本）或者本题这样宽度递减的优化问题。与之对比，「快慢指针」模式用于链表的环检测，「滑动窗口」模式用于子串/子数组问题。理解这些不同的双指针变体，是解决中等难度数组题目的关键。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 11 盛最多水的容器","id":"leetcode-11-盛最多水的容器"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"暴力解法","id":"暴力解法"},{"level":3,"text":"双指针法","id":"双指针法"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"进一步优化：跳过不可能更优的高度","id":"进一步优化-跳过不可能更优的高度"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 75 颜色分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0075-sort-colors"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 15 三数之和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0015-three-sum"}}